WEBVTT

00:59:59.954 --> 01:00:01.829
I had stayed close to my
comment the whole time.

01:00:01.829 --> 01:00:05.163
I thought it was just this incredible
group of people and spirit

01:00:06.121 --> 01:00:11.496
and set of incentives and just badly
misunderstood by most of the world,

01:00:11.496 --> 01:00:14.996
but obvious to everyone within it that it
was going to create huge amounts of

01:00:14.996 --> 01:00:16.579
value and do a lot of new things.

01:00:19.163 --> 01:00:22.413
My company had acquired PJI,
who is the founder of ICI,

01:00:22.413 --> 01:00:26.163
and like truly one of the most incredible
humans and business people.

01:00:26.163 --> 01:00:29.663
And Paul Burrell, Paul Graham asked
me if I wanted to run it.

01:00:29.913 --> 01:00:32.246
And kind of like the central
learning of my career,